# NaMiOS — man hinh KHOA (lock screen) "dong bo" voi man hinh dang nhap
# SDDM, nhung BANG MOT CO CHE KHAC — doc ky truoc khi sua.
#
# TAI SAO KHONG CO contents/lockscreen/LockScreen.qml trong mot goi
# Plasma/LookAndFeel (nhu nhiem vu ban dau gia dinh "IF that's where the
# lock screen lives (check first)"): DA KIEM TRA truc tiep ma nguon KDE cho
# DUNG ban Plasma 6.3.6 (Debian 13 trixie dong goi — xem ghi chu goi trong
# includes.chroot/usr/share/sddm/themes/breeze/theme.conf.user) va xac nhan
# PHU DINH:
#   1) github.com/KDE/plasma-desktop tag v6.3.6, thu muc
#      lookandfeel/org.kde.breeze/contents/ — KHONG CO thu muc "lockscreen"
#      nao ca (chi co defaults/layouts/logout/osd/previews/splash/
#      systemdialog). Goi LookAndFeel KHONG con mang theo lockscreen QML
#      rieng o ban nay.
#   2) github.com/KDE/kscreenlocker tag v6.3.6, file greeter/greeterapp.cpp —
#      ham UnlockApp::setShell() nap mot goi KPackage KIEU "Plasma/Shell"
#      (KHONG phai "Plasma/LookAndFeel"), mac dinh ten goi la
#      "org.kde.plasma.desktop" (chinh goi Shell cua desktop, dung chung voi
#      bo cuc panel/containment), roi doc file "lockscreenmainscript" BEN
#      TRONG goi Shell do — neu khong tai duoc (verifyPackageApi that bai) se
#      fallback ve UI nhung dung san nhung trong chinh binary kscreenlocker
#      (qrc:/fallbacktheme/LockScreen.qml, "org.kde.passworddialog").
#
# NGHIA LA: de thuc su thay the UI lock screen can FORK goi Shell
# "org.kde.plasma.desktop" (anh huong CA bo cuc desktop/panel mac dinh, KHONG
# chi lock screen) va doi Shell mac dinh toan he thong — RUI RO/PHAM VI lon
# hon han mot file theme/LnF don le, KHONG lam "mu" trong phien nay (khong co
# build host de kiem chung, du an da nhieu lan nhan manh "khong gia lap de
# bao dat"). DE XUAT rieng cho mot wave sau, co may build + boot thuc de lap
# lai nhieu lan an toan.
#
# PHUONG AN THAT O DAY (an toan, da xac nhan tu dung ma nguon
# kscreenlocker v6.3.6, file settings/wallpaper_integration.cpp): kscreenlocker
# doc hinh nen rieng cho man hinh khoa qua nhom cau hinh
#   [Greeter][Wallpaper][org.kde.image][General]
# (ham m_config->group("Greeter").group("Wallpaper").group(pluginName), roi
# nap schema cua chinh plugin "org.kde.image" — xac nhan key "Image" ="duong
# dan anh" tu schema THAT cua plugin nay:
# plasma-workspace v6.3.6 wallpapers/image/imagepackage/contents/config/main.xml,
# nhom [General], entry "Image" type String). Dat CUNG anh nen da dung cho
# SDDM (namios-default.png, xem includes.chroot/usr/share/sddm/themes/namios/
# theme.conf) de hai man hinh doc cung mot anh nen thuong hieu. Mau sac/font
# cua chu dong ho + o mat khau tren lock screen mac dinh cua Plasma (Shell
# "org.kde.plasma.desktop", UI noi tai) tu doc theo color scheme he thong
# dang hoat dong — he thong nay DA set san "NaMiOS-Sen"/mau brand.json qua
# etc/skel/.config/kdeglobals (ColorScheme=NaMiOS-Sen) nen chu/dong ho/khung
# o mat khau tren lock screen se tu nhien ra mau mục đêm/đỏ son MA KHONG can
# QML rieng — day la ly do chinh "matching" dat duoc qua mau he thong + anh
# nen chung, khong qua mot ban sao QML rui ro.
#
# File nay dat o /etc/xdg/ (TANG MAC DINH HE THONG cua KConfig/XDG, KHONG
# phai skel — khac voi etc/skel/ bi cam dong trong nhiem vu nay): KConfig
# doc /etc/xdg/<ten-file> nhu lop gia tri mac dinh BEN DUOI
# ~/.config/<ten-file> cua tung user, ca nguoi dung moi tao SAU va nguoi
# dung co san deu thay gia tri nay tru khi ho tu doi trong System
# Settings > Lock Screen > Wallpaper (co che cascading chuan cua KDE
# Frameworks, KHONG can ghi vao etc/skel/).
#
# verified_on_host: NO — CHUA chay qua boot/lock man hinh that. Dieu CAO RUI
# RO NHAT can boot thuc de xac nhan: (1) kscreenlocker THAT doc dung nhom
# [Greeter][Wallpaper][org.kde.image][General] tu /etc/xdg/kscreenlockerrc
# (co the user da co ~/.config/kscreenlockerrc rieng de len tren, dung mong
# doi neu may da duoc dung qua); (2) anh namios-default.png hien dung tren man
# hinh khoa (khac luc KHOA man hinh vs. luc dang nhap — UI khac nhau, chi anh
# nen + mau he thong la dong bo, KHONG phai pixel-giong-nhau 100%).
[Greeter][Wallpaper][org.kde.image][General]
Image=/usr/share/backgrounds/namios/namios-default.png
